{"chunk_id": "acce213a7764", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "", "text": "华为云码道介绍\n华为云码道（CodeArts）代码智能体是华为云于 2026 年 2 月 26 日正式发布公测的企业级工程化 AI 编码智能体，融合华为 20 余年研发经验与千亿行代码沉淀，集代码大模型、智能 IDE、自主开发模式于一体，面向端到端研发全流程。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "acce213a7764", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "c70bee42f6fb", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "智能体核心能力（Agent 模式）", "date_hint": "", "text": "复杂任务规划：自然语言需求→结构化执行步骤，自动跟踪进度。\n跨文件代码生成 / 修改：支持多文件同步变更，适配大型项目。\n智能工具调用：代码搜索、文件读写、Shell 执行、环境操作。\n交互确认：关键步骤人工审核，保障安全可控。\nCodebase 深度索引：理解项目上下文，提升代码准确性。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "c70bee42f6fb", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "9d2ba5e7f504", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心 AICoding 功能", "date_hint": "", "text": "代码生成 / 续写 / 重构\n研发知识问答（华为 / 行业规范）\n单元测试用例自动生成\n规范驱动开发（合规校验）\n漏洞治理与安全检测", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "9d2ba5e7f504", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
