{"chunk_id": "5394a843a3f3", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "模型生态（多模型融合）", "date_hint": "", "text": "开源模型：GLM-5.0、DeepSeek-V3.2（公测主力）\n华为专属：鸿蒙（ArkTS）、昇腾专属模型\n扩展：开放第三方模型接入接口，四层智能体扩展架构", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "5394a843a3f3", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "78822b0f222b", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "关键优势", "date_hint": "", "text": "工程化优先：适配百万行级 Java / 企业级项目，长周期维护友好\n鸿蒙原生支持：深度优化 ArkTS，鸿蒙开发效率显著提升\n效率提升：Codebase 上下文理解，同等任务成本降低约 30%\n安全可控：版权归属用户，关键步骤人工确认\nIDE 集成：支持 VS Code 插件（CodeArts Agent），无缝接入现有开发环境", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "78822b0f222b", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
